  "description": "Zentura is a sophisticated modern luxury serif font that combines elegant high-contrast letterforms with a refined and graceful character. Its slender proportions, stylish curves, and distinctive ligatures create a timeless yet contemporary aesthetic, making every word feel polished and premium. Designed to bring elegance and visual sophistication to your projects, Zentura works beautifully for luxurious branding, fashion identities, editorial layouts, and refined display typography. Whether you’re creating a high-end logo, beauty packaging, wedding stationery, or an elegant headline, Zentura adds a classy and memorable touch to every design.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Zentura is a sophisticated modern luxury serif font that combines elegant high-contrast letterforms with a refined and graceful character. Its slender proportions, stylish curves, and distinctive ligatures create a timeless yet contemporary aesthetic, making every word feel polished and premium. Designed to bring elegance and visual sophistication to your projects, Zentura works beautifully for luxurious branding, fashion identities, editorial layouts, and refined display typography. Whether you’re creating a high-end logo, beauty packaging, wedding stationery, or an elegant headline, Zentura adds a classy and memorable touch to every design.</p>",
